// Clue - Agree1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1459282456" "Mike Sanders"
// DetailString :
"P1164426847" "Mike Sanders was a very agreeable citizen. From the very moment you started talking to him he was very cordial and even seemed exited at the opportunity not only to talk to you, but to serve Praetoria. He signed up for the volunteer study without a hitch."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Agree2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3303810474" "Carla Bean"
// DetailString :
"P4047505217" "Carla was friendly when you first approached her, but then the mention of the study changed her attitude. When questioned about her reluctance she dismissed the question of her loyalty and insinuated that she had heard rumor that lead her to question Neuron's capabilities and her own safety under his care. Ultimately she conceeded her fears and agreed to the volunteer study."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RefuseClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P997981791" "Harold Ishida"
// DetailString :
"P877390602" "Harold was cordial, but the moment you wanted to talk to him about one of Neuron's studies, he grew difficult and outright refused to volunteer for the study."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HaroldClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P576473752" "Hello? Is this thing working? Ugh... I hate having to work. Hey... Hey! Okay, now I hear you. Listen, I need you to do something for me."
// AcceptString :
"P2865047185" "Accept"
// SendOffString :
"P3169624433" "Neuron needs some people recruited for a new study. He asked me to do it but I'm using a new skill I learned. It's called delegating responsibility. All you have to do is go and talk to a few people and convince them to volunteer for the study."

