"P515935401" "You got the 3 people?<br><br>No!?<br><br>Listen, I don't care what you have to do to get that last volunteer... Wait, Neuron told me I couldn't kidnap people, so I'll just play dumb and tell him that I delegated to someone in powers division and they did it...<br><br>This Ishida fellow... his loyalty seems questionable, I want you to find a reason to arrest him and bring him here!"

