"P4272468094" "IVette"
// DetailString :
"P2869897929" "This clockwork android is the android that the scientists were using as their test bed for some new software. But what would they have installed that would turn her violent and unruly?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P72578411" "Mrrrrrow... Hello?<br><br>Ugh, what? What do you want?<br><br>Wait! Wait! Don't go, I'm sorry... I got a job for you. Interested?"
// SendOffString :
"P2222139504" "Yay! You make me happy. ^_^ <br><br>Okay, Neuron had some scientist install a new program in some clockwork and then the clockwork went berserk and now the scientists are all in danger and... Yaaaaaaaaawn.<br><br>Yeah, I know, totally boring. Anyway, he asked me to... um, find someone to help clean up the situation.<br><br>Guess what? That's you! Aren't you excited?<br><br>Good, now don't bother me until it's done, I have to get back to my nap, bye!"
