// Task - P_SL3_NT_Bobcat_G_Task4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NeuronFieldClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P704842682" "Neuron Field"
// DetailString :
"P1176489644" "Neuron has installed one of his latest inventions on you, the Neuron Field. The device gives you enhanced speed, reflexes, and reactions, theoretically accelerating you into the realm of Neuron's own super speed. He wants you to test the device out by fighting some of the Failed Experiments that have infested parts of the tunnels beneath Neutropolis, thereby killing two birds with one ingenious stone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NeuronMessageClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1608458636" "Fight Axon N-37"
// DetailString :
"P3372815295" "{HeroName}, my sensors indicate that one of my earlier experiments is up ahead, Axon N-37. I would very much like you to gather some data on it for me. Destroy it and prove that the Neuron Device is superior."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AxonClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2459366282" "The Axon N-37"
// DetailString :
"P1232964366" "The device surgically installed into Axon's head was remarkably similar, albeit less refined, than the Neuron Field that Neuron gave you. You suspect that Axon N-37 was actually the name of the device, and not the individual. He was probably one of Neuron's earlier test beds for the Neuron Field technology. You wonder if you might experience similar results with extended use of the current permutation of the device."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NeuronFieldReportClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1993280989" "Report on the Neuron Field"
// DetailString :
"P3577058661" "These are the results of your test of the Neuron Field, scientifically recorded thanks to another of Neuron's brilliant devices, an Omniscan Nodule which was grafted seemlessly into the Neuron Field device. Return the report to Neuron so he can finish his testing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BobcatLazyClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1620108495" "Bobcat is Lazy"
// DetailString :
"P1165948112" "Neuron's words, not yours. It would seem that Neuron doesn't approve of Bobcat's relaxed, self-pampering lifestyle. It isn't that surprising, you imagine that everyone seems lazy to Neuron. You've even heard he doesn't sleep and complains that he can't work as fast as his mind can."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P915684403" "Well, well, well, aren't you the big shot around here. Looks like you caught Neuron's eye, 'cause he wants you to help him out with something."
// SendOffString :
"P3448929682" "No, I don't know what it is, which has me seriously annoyed. It's like he's keeping secrets from me... I don't like him keeping secrets.<br><br>Tell me what he's working on when you're done. Please?"

