// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1365264186" "Lazy? Lazy!? I do everything around here! Er, well, I make everyone else do everything around here. Same diff, right?<br><br>Ugh! I can't believe Neuron would say that! It's all that Assistant Browning's fault. She's turning him against me!<br><br>She's smart, understands what he says half the time, and does as she's told... Grrrrrr!<br><br>How'm I supposed to compete with that!?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL3_NT_Bobcat_G_Task5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BobcatNervousClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2076957281" ""Scardy Cat"
// DetailString :
"P1003652480" "Maybe it was her ears laid black or her wide eyes, but Bobcat seemed really nervous about this task and relieved when you agreed to do it. You'd better tread carefully though, if Bobcat is spooked, who knows what you could be up against."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WyvernClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4115137239" "Resistance?"
// DetailString :
"P727099199" "You haven't a clue who these guys are, but they are not Resistance, and they aren't talking."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ArachnosClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3333220597" "Arachnos?"
// DetailString :
"P1321705670" "You questioned the one individual who was more out of place here than anyone else and all you got was a name; Arachnos."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - StrangeTerroristClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P294984286" "Strange Terrorists"
// DetailString :
"P199572139" "One of the Armatech Labs scientists that you rescued said that they'd never seen anything on the news that talked about Resistance members dressing quite like these guys. He is intrigued by their choice of weapons and equipment, likening them to Praetor Sinclair's secret police."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SecondGroupClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P389376067" "Two Heaping Scoops of Trouble"
// DetailString :
"P16158242" "According to the Praetorian Armament Systems scientist you rescued, the strange terrorists that took over the lab are actually the second group of strangers to do so today. The first group accessed their computers and then left. The small guard that remained to watch over them was quickly dispatched by the second group when they arrived."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - IrongripStorageClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2978673737" "Gripiron Storage"
// DetailString :
"P2844085817" "According to the leader of the strange terrorist group, a third party called Arachnos has discovered that Praetorian Armament Systems stores some of their products in Gripiron Storage and they have headed there to loot the place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ArachnosLeaderClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P469385292" "The Arachnos Leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MissingEquipmentClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3789414843" "Missing Equipment"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - StolenEquipmentClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1465397998" "Recovered Equipment"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P777314237" "Hey bestest friend ever! Have I told you how much you mean to me lately?<br><br>No? Oh... Well, you mean lots. Really!<br><br>Now that I've been nice to you can you be nice for me?"
// SendOffString :
"P3332138451" "Good... Good... Whatwasthat!?.<br><br>Sorry, just sorta, wigged out. Heh heh.<br><br>It's nothing, don't worry about it. I need... I mean, Neuron would like you to check out some possible terrorist activity at one of his labs. Go stomp 'em!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL3_NT_Bobcat_G_Task5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3853248373" "Stop Terrorists at Praetorian Armament Systems"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2326279015" "Are they gone? Did you get 'em? Oh... Well get over to Praetorian Armament Systems, what are you waiting for?"

